  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environment, CC and DRM component Binational programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific objective of the Action is to increase binational cooperation capacity for disaster risk reduction and sustainable management of natural resources through adaptation measures for climate change. The Action will target the binational river basin of Pedernales. The anticipated results are: Result 1: Protection of the population living in the river basin against natural hazards is improved; Result 2: Natural resource degradation is reduced in order to increase population access to environmental services; Result 3: Binational coordination at local level on environmental issues is strengthened; and Result 4: Binational collaboration is strengthened at institutional level in environment, disaster risk management and in climate change adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
